","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m004-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p005","text":"天子使莊助往諭意南越王，胡頓首曰：「天子乃為臣興兵討閩越，死無以報德！」遣太子嬰齊入宿衛。謂助曰：「國新被寇，使者行矣。胡方日夜裝入見天子。」助去後，其大臣諫胡曰：「漢興兵誅郢，亦行以驚動南越。且先王昔言，事天子期無失禮，要之不可以說好語入見。入見則不得復歸，亡國之勢也。」於是胡稱病，竟不入見。後十餘歲，胡實病甚，太子嬰齊請歸。胡薨，謚為文王。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"g0x_vmx_2lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"莊助","kind":"person","person_id":"8eg_ctq_fxg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"mo6_b19_odk_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"g0x_vmx_2lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"助","kind":"person","person_id":"8eg_ctq_fxg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"mo6_b19_odk_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"g0x_vmx_2lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"助","kind":"person","person_id":"8eg_ctq_fxg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"胡